 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 518478,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "A simple interest loan for $1,400 is taken out at 12.5% annual percentage rate. A partial payment of $700 is made 20 days into the loan period. After this payment, what will the remaining balance of the loan be?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"I = P \\times r \\times t = 1,400 \\times 0.125 \\times \\frac{{20}}{{365}} \\approx \\$ 9.59\"></span></td>\n<td>(rounded to the nearest cent)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Subtract the interest off the loan payment.</p>\n<p>$700 – 9.59 = $690.41 went toward paying off the loan.</p>\n<p>$1,400 – 690.41 = $709.59 is the remaining balance of the loan.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "$709.59"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 518479,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "A simple interest loan for $23,000 is taken out at 7.25% annual percentage rate. A partial payment of $10,000 is made 40 days into the loan period. After this payment, what will the remaining balance of the loan be?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"I = P \\times r \\times t = 23,000 \\times 0.0725 \\times \\frac{{40}}{{365}} \\approx \\$ 182.74\"></span></td>\n<td>(rounded to the nearest cent)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Subtract the interest off the loan payment.</p>\n<p>$10,000 – 182.74 = $9,817.26 went toward paying off the loan.</p>\n<p>$23,000 – 9,817.26 = $13,182.74 is the remaining balance of the loan.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "$13,182.74"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
